          "message": "feat(pulls): allow disabling agit prompt (#1025)\n\nAllow users to set TEA_USE_AGIT=0 or TEA_USE_AGIT=false to skip the interactive agit flow prompt during pull request creation.\n\nThis keeps the current default behavior unchanged and only suppresses the agit confirmation when the environment variable explicitly parses to false.\n\nVerified with:\n\n- go test ./modules/interact\n- go build ./...\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: silverwind <redacted@example.invalid>\nCo-authored-by: Leon Müller <redacted@example.invalid>\nReviewed-on: https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1025\nReviewed-by: silverwind <redacted@example.invalid>\nCo-authored-by: LeonM <redacted@example.invalid>\n",
